{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55302","headline":"华阴道中逢月出 · 赵匡胤","name":"华阴道中逢月出","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未离海底（《藏一话腴》作「峤」）千山黑（《扪蝨新话》作「暗」），才到天中（《扪蝨新话》作「中天」、《藏一话腴》作「天心」）万国明。\n（见《後山诗话》，校以《说郛》本《藏一话腴》、陈善《扪蝨新话》卷二。\n题从《扪蝨新话》。\n《藏一话腴》谓此二句系国史据《日诗》）润色之。\n（按：宋人均记载匡胤二诗爲其微时作。\n若可信，当作於晋汉之际。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵匡胤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55302.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55302","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}